    "quote": "He explained that if NVIDIA merely provided a guarantee for a data center facility lease, “you’d still face the question of ‘how to finance the GPUs’”; but if NVIDIA commits to purchasing any unsold compute capacity within the facility, “the GPU financing issue is resolved—and so is the data center’s financing problem.”",
    "one_line": "A data center executive said a guarantee of a facility lease alone would not address GPU financing, while NVIDIA’s commitment to buy unsold facility compute capacity would address both GPU and data-center financing problems.",
    "speaker": "A data center executive",
    "original_who": "A data center executive",
    "original_day": "2026-07-01",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
    "id": "e13",
    "quote": "According to prior reporting by The Information, NVIDIA has also recently been negotiating to provide financial guarantees for OpenAI’s lease of a large data center in Ohio—an asset that, if fully built out at current prices for chips, labor, power, and other materials, could cost as much as $500 billion.",
    "one_line": "The Information had reported that NVIDIA was negotiating to guarantee OpenAI’s lease of a large Ohio data center; the facility could cost as much as $500 billion if fully built at then-current input prices.",
    "speaker": "The Information, as reported by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "rumour"
   },
   {
    "id": "e14",
    "quote": "To date, NVIDIA has invested several billion dollars in equity stakes in multiple emerging cloud service providers and, in certain cases, agreed to lease back chips from these companies—including CoreWeave and Lambda—in transactions totaling several billion dollars.",
    "one_line": "The Information reported that NVIDIA had invested several billion dollars in equity stakes in multiple emerging cloud providers and had agreed in some cases to lease chips back, including from CoreWeave and Lambda, in transactions totaling several billion dollars.",
    "speaker": "moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
    "id": "e15",
    "quote": "According to prior reporting by The Information, NVIDIA’s own researchers have also used GPU servers leased back from Lambda.",
    "one_line": "The Information had reported that NVIDIA researchers used GPU servers leased back from Lambda.",
    "speaker": "The Information, as reported by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
    "id": "e16",
    "quote": "In September 2024, NVIDIA committed to purchasing all of CoreWeave’s unsold capacity through 2032 if CoreWeave failed to secure tenants, under a contract then valued at $6.3 billion.",
    "one_line": "In September 2024, NVIDIA committed to purchase all CoreWeave capacity left unsold for lack of tenants through 2032 under a contract then valued at $6.3 billion.",
    "speaker": "moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "NVIDIA",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "fact"
   },
   {
    "id": "e17",
    "quote": "According to a regulatory filing submitted by NVIDIA in May of this year (covering the quarter ended in April), NVIDIA subsequently added another $3.5 billion to guarantee customer data center leases in exchange for rights to purchase their shares.",
    "one_line": "NVIDIA’s May 2026 regulatory filing for the quarter ended in April reported that the company had added $3.5 billion to guarantee customer data-center leases in exchange for rights to purchase their shares.",
    "speaker": "NVIDIA",
    "original_who": "NVIDIA",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "fact"
   }
  ]
 }
